WEBVTT

00:00:01.660 --> 00:00:03.670
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:06.000
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:08.800
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:20.470
<b>Kinou made no ruuru kyou wa tada no ruuzu</b>

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:20.470
<i>Yesterday’s rules are simply loose today</i>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.520
<b>Kowashite dantotsu gooru</b>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.520
<i>The best goal is to break them</i>

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:27.560
<b>hashiri tudukete nai to</b>

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:27.560
<i>If I don’t keep running</i>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.940
<b>hokani imi wa nai to</b>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.940
<i>There’s no other meaning</i>

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:34.150
<b>Panku na tetsukaku nanda</b>

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:34.150
<i>It’s a punk philosophy</i>

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:39.330
<b>Baiorizumu wa tsuubai rizumu de</b>

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:39.330
<i>Biorhythm is a two-time rhythm</i>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.370
<b>Fuukei wa shunkan ni musuu no sen</b>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.370
<i>The scenery instantly becomes countless lines</i>

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:46.330
<b>Ore wo torimaku kaze</b>

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:46.330
<i>The wind envelops me</i>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<b>Inside Outside semete</b>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<i>Inside Outside attack</i>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<b>Issai gassai nuite</b>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<i>Surpass everything altogether</i>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:55.430
<b>Dare hitori monani hitotsu mo</b>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:58.140
<i>I won’t let no one and nothing go forward</i>

00:00:55.430 --> 00:00:58.140
<b>Mae wo ikasetaku wa nai</b>

00:00:58.140 --> 00:01:00.470
<b>Inside Outside GO! SONIC!!</b>

00:00:58.140 --> 00:01:00.470
<i>Inside Outside, Go! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:00.470 --> 00:01:02.850
<b>Issai gassai Yes! SONIC!!</b>

00:01:00.470 --> 00:01:02.850
<i>Everything altogether Yes! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:06.020
<b>Abunai yo to Have A Nice wa niteru</b>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:06.020
<i>“Watch out” and “Have a nice” are similar</i>

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:08.670
<b>Soudochira mo kamihitoe na no sa</b>

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:08.670
<i>That’s right – both are by the skin of your teeth</i>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:17.160
<b>Taikutsu nugisuteteima sugu kakedase</b>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:17.160
<i>Throw boredom away and start running right now</i>

00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:22.290
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:24.750
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:28.460
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:01:31.920 --> 00:01:40.510
My fellow citizens, our military forces today launched an all-out attack against Dr. Eggman.

00:01:41.610 --> 00:01:44.620
Dr. Eggman intends to conquer the world.

00:01:45.440 --> 00:01:49.110
We cannot allow him to this!

00:01:55.030 --> 00:01:58.200
This has become grim.

00:01:59.500 --> 00:02:04.540
Episode 13

00:01:59.500 --> 00:02:04.540
After the Attack on Eggman's Base

00:02:27.960 --> 00:02:29.340
Launching missile.

00:02:58.320 --> 00:02:59.200
Wait.

00:03:00.300 --> 00:03:01.420
What is it?

00:03:01.680 --> 00:03:04.940
I'm not happy about it, but it seems our host has come to welcome us.

00:03:11.180 --> 00:03:12.180
Let's go!

00:03:12.590 --> 00:03:13.590
Rouge!

00:03:24.290 --> 00:03:28.390
Chris, Francis... Please be safe.

00:03:51.790 --> 00:03:53.760
What's the deal with this wind?

00:03:53.830 --> 00:03:54.860
Francis!

00:03:54.930 --> 00:03:56.580
No! Stay down!

00:04:00.980 --> 00:04:03.350
That's why I told you to stay down!

00:04:03.550 --> 00:04:05.110
I'm sorry.

00:04:05.460 --> 00:04:07.180
Where's Tails?

00:04:07.530 --> 00:04:09.230
I think he's passed out.

00:04:15.580 --> 00:04:17.070
Tails!

00:04:26.570 --> 00:04:31.930
E-35, crush that lame robot while Tails is still inside.

00:04:51.690 --> 00:04:53.070
Tails!

00:04:56.080 --> 00:04:57.580
Kill him!

00:05:05.050 --> 00:05:06.740
Sonic!

00:05:22.730 --> 00:05:23.900
The wind is...

00:05:45.820 --> 00:05:47.340
Thank you, Sonic!

00:05:49.520 --> 00:05:52.560
More importantly, what are you doing here?

00:05:52.780 --> 00:05:55.440
We came to get the third Chaos Emerald.

00:05:55.510 --> 00:05:57.980
Oh, that's right! We have to dig it out!

00:05:58.610 --> 00:05:59.960
Hey, hey!

00:06:09.710 --> 00:06:13.780
Don't move. Tails is looking for something important right now.

00:06:20.780 --> 00:06:23.830
I guess you don't understand verbal communication.

00:06:26.300 --> 00:06:27.400
Sonic!

00:06:30.350 --> 00:06:31.350
Got it.

00:06:49.100 --> 00:06:50.410
I found it!

00:06:50.480 --> 00:06:52.830
Good work, Tails.

00:07:00.610 --> 00:07:01.740
Eggman!

00:07:09.930 --> 00:07:11.430
We're chasing after him, Tails.

00:07:12.120 --> 00:07:13.470
Right!

00:07:15.160 --> 00:07:16.350
Okay.

00:07:18.800 --> 00:07:19.650
What?

00:07:20.810 --> 00:07:24.620
Francis, I don't think you should come.

00:07:24.920 --> 00:07:26.040
Why not?

00:07:26.550 --> 00:07:27.800
Because it's dangerous!

00:07:27.800 --> 00:07:27.810
Chris? Because it's dangerous!

00:07:27.810 --> 00:07:28.900
Chris?

00:07:29.710 --> 00:07:31.690
Are you in or out?

00:07:32.380 --> 00:07:34.330
I'm in!

00:07:51.790 --> 00:07:53.110
Let's go!

00:08:16.940 --> 00:08:17.870
Now!

00:08:20.290 --> 00:08:21.250
Okay!

00:08:40.150 --> 00:08:41.560
Wow.

00:08:44.230 --> 00:08:47.390
There's trouble both inside and outside.

00:08:52.850 --> 00:08:56.460
Something's coming again! We have to counterattack!

00:08:56.990 --> 00:08:59.030
Take it down!

00:09:03.580 --> 00:09:05.700
You idiots! It's me!

00:09:15.020 --> 00:09:16.810
Everything is a mess.

00:09:18.750 --> 00:09:24.560
But I have to teach them a lesson on what happens when you underestimate me.

00:09:27.970 --> 00:09:31.170
Why? Why is this happening?

00:09:35.470 --> 00:09:37.560
The battle is increasing in intensity.

00:09:39.110 --> 00:09:40.170
What's that?

00:09:41.650 --> 00:09:43.780
Something is approaching the base.

00:09:45.070 --> 00:09:46.320
It looks like an airplane.

00:09:47.790 --> 00:09:49.360
It's the X-Tornado!

00:09:50.050 --> 00:09:51.370
What's that?

00:09:51.400 --> 00:09:52.910
I wonder what it is.

00:09:52.940 --> 00:09:54.850
Something is on top of it.

00:09:55.350 --> 00:09:56.580
It's blue.

00:09:57.990 --> 00:09:59.240
It's a blue...

00:09:59.960 --> 00:10:01.490
...hedgehog?

00:10:01.590 --> 00:10:02.820
It's Sonic!

00:10:07.140 --> 00:10:08.340
What's that?

00:10:08.550 --> 00:10:09.780
Who is that?

00:10:10.200 --> 00:10:11.770
Sonic is Sonic.

00:10:11.940 --> 00:10:13.980
Sonic the Hedgehog!

00:10:36.940 --> 00:10:38.400
That's the location.

00:10:46.870 --> 00:10:48.370
Is that the same robot as before?

00:10:48.500 --> 00:10:51.500
No. It means there's more than one of them.

00:10:51.790 --> 00:10:55.090
I'll take care of this, so you all go to the power station.

00:10:56.920 --> 00:10:58.630
Everyone, we're going in!

00:11:16.110 --> 00:11:17.650
You're such a nuisance!

00:11:25.530 --> 00:11:26.660
Topaz!

00:11:32.170 --> 00:11:33.330
Knuckles?

00:11:48.600 --> 00:11:51.390
Thank you. Are you one of Sonic's friends?

00:11:51.440 --> 00:11:52.640
He's not my friend!

00:11:53.440 --> 00:11:55.020
But do you know him?

00:11:55.400 --> 00:12:00.360
I guess. So what are you guys doing here?

00:12:00.650 --> 00:12:03.360
We came to destroy Eggman's base.

00:12:03.490 --> 00:12:06.870
We will destroy the power station and stop the base from functioning.

00:12:07.160 --> 00:12:12.210
That idea is reckless. You don't know if you can even get out of here alive.

00:12:13.170 --> 00:12:15.080
We're aware of that possibility.

00:12:16.250 --> 00:12:17.340
I see.

00:12:17.880 --> 00:12:19.630
Then I'll go with you.

00:12:20.090 --> 00:12:28.970
As someone who came from the same alternate world as Dr. Eggman, I can't allow him to destroy this world any further.

00:12:28.970 --> 00:12:31.680
Oh my, you have such great sense of justice.

00:12:32.270 --> 00:12:33.980
What did you say?

00:12:34.230 --> 00:12:36.060
Nothing special.

00:12:38.320 --> 00:12:39.360
You idiots!

00:12:39.520 --> 00:12:44.360
Can't you tell the difference between me and the enemy?

00:12:45.950 --> 00:12:47.660
Sniff...

00:12:50.490 --> 00:12:51.790
Sonic...

00:12:53.330 --> 00:12:56.250
I'll shoot you down!

00:12:59.590 --> 00:13:00.670
What's that?

00:13:00.710 --> 00:13:02.170
Anti-aircraft missiles!

00:13:02.630 --> 00:13:06.260
Whoa!

00:13:28.990 --> 00:13:30.830
How's that!

00:13:34.450 --> 00:13:35.910
No biggie.

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:38.710
We're going to be shot down!

00:13:38.710 --> 00:13:41.000
Don't panic.

00:13:41.250 --> 00:13:43.590
Take that and that and that.

00:13:48.760 --> 00:13:49.930
They're in danger!

00:13:49.930 --> 00:13:52.640
No, Sonic and his friends won't be defeated!

00:13:54.640 --> 00:13:56.270
Tails, the missiles!

00:13:56.270 --> 00:13:57.520
I know.

00:14:07.490 --> 00:14:10.160
That was so cool!

00:14:12.780 --> 00:14:14.700
This feels great.

00:14:15.700 --> 00:14:17.370
Sonic!

00:14:18.420 --> 00:14:27.090
Sonic!

00:14:31.600 --> 00:14:33.970
Sonic, will that do?

00:14:34.180 --> 00:14:35.100
Just fine!

00:14:58.290 --> 00:15:00.540
So you came, hedgehog!

00:15:00.620 --> 00:15:04.750
Today, I will finally defeat you with my own hands!

00:15:22.690 --> 00:15:24.150
Bring it!

00:15:24.310 --> 00:15:26.150
Here I go, Eggman!

00:15:37.540 --> 00:15:39.620
The time bomb is set.

00:15:40.500 --> 00:15:43.080
Understood. We're done, Rouge.

00:15:43.670 --> 00:15:46.290
Huh? Where is she?

00:15:47.090 --> 00:15:48.920
She's still up there.

00:15:50.630 --> 00:15:52.680
I wonder what she's doing.

00:15:56.720 --> 00:15:59.180
So this place was being monitored.

00:15:59.180 --> 00:16:00.430
Rouge!

00:16:00.980 --> 00:16:02.020
What?

00:16:02.060 --> 00:16:04.270
What are you doing? We have to leave.

00:16:04.650 --> 00:16:06.310
You can leave without me.

00:16:06.400 --> 00:16:07.690
C'mon you!

00:16:08.190 --> 00:16:10.900
I still have work to do.

00:16:12.240 --> 00:16:15.870
Do you think they're on our side?

00:16:16.410 --> 00:16:21.830
I'm not sure, so let's not attack.

00:16:22.210 --> 00:16:23.210
Okay.

00:16:27.540 --> 00:16:29.090
Oh my.

00:16:29.800 --> 00:16:31.550
What's going on?

00:16:31.760 --> 00:16:33.220
We're locked in.

00:16:33.760 --> 00:16:35.220
This is really thick.

00:16:42.140 --> 00:16:43.640
It's hard.

00:16:43.730 --> 00:16:45.060
Leave it to me!

00:16:50.780 --> 00:16:52.990
Even my fists can't break it?

00:17:06.790 --> 00:17:08.380
Cam we disarm it?

00:17:13.510 --> 00:17:15.550
Oh no...

00:17:16.130 --> 00:17:17.680
Don't give up!

00:17:17.890 --> 00:17:20.350
That's right. If you give up, you lose.

00:17:39.200 --> 00:17:40.990
This is fun!

00:17:43.410 --> 00:17:44.410
You're pretty good.

00:17:47.120 --> 00:17:49.130
You still don't understand?

00:17:55.970 --> 00:17:59.720
Even you managed to make a decent robot.

00:18:00.430 --> 00:18:08.440
You won't be talking back much longer. E-18 is powered by a Chaos Emerald.

00:18:08.900 --> 00:18:10.690
Or should i say two.

00:18:12.150 --> 00:18:13.820
I see.

00:18:14.440 --> 00:18:16.900
It's about time to finish you off.

00:18:18.610 --> 00:18:19.740
Hello?

00:18:19.990 --> 00:18:27.830
Dr. Eggman, we trapped some people in the power station, but are they friends or foes?

00:18:31.500 --> 00:18:32.670
Knuckles!

00:18:34.500 --> 00:18:36.760
Of course they're enemies!

00:18:36.800 --> 00:18:38.970
I see. They're enemies.

00:18:39.090 --> 00:18:41.930
What were they doing in the power station?

00:18:42.390 --> 00:18:45.930
They were saying something about a time bomb.

00:18:45.930 --> 00:18:47.270
What?

00:18:57.690 --> 00:18:59.110
We're finished...

00:18:59.110 --> 00:19:00.490
I'm not going to give up!

00:19:00.990 --> 00:19:02.870
Talk about hopeless.

00:19:05.370 --> 00:19:10.540
How foolish are you to set a time bomb and get locked into the same room?

00:19:15.340 --> 00:19:16.590
Sonic!

00:19:20.760 --> 00:19:23.930
Don't you ever learn?

00:19:24.640 --> 00:19:25.720
Whatever!

00:19:30.730 --> 00:19:31.850
What?

00:19:39.690 --> 00:19:41.240
No way!

00:19:46.120 --> 00:19:47.330
Yahoo!

00:19:47.370 --> 00:19:49.370
Oh no!

00:20:15.940 --> 00:20:17.730
I'm done for!

00:20:40.510 --> 00:20:42.130
What's going on?

00:20:42.760 --> 00:20:44.130
It's probably Sonic.

00:20:44.260 --> 00:20:46.220
I'm not playing second fiddle to Sonic!

00:20:51.850 --> 00:20:52.850
I did it!

00:20:52.930 --> 00:20:53.850
Watch out!

00:20:58.020 --> 00:20:59.690
Sonic, how dare you!

00:21:00.530 --> 00:21:02.490
Get off me, will ya?

00:21:02.740 --> 00:21:03.990
What did you say?

00:21:04.450 --> 00:21:07.370
I saved your life. You can't even say 'thank you'?

00:21:08.070 --> 00:21:10.620
I don't remember asking you to save me!

00:21:10.830 --> 00:21:11.870
You're the worst!

00:21:11.870 --> 00:21:14.830
What are you two doing? We have to escape!

00:22:03.130 --> 00:22:05.630
S... Sonic...

00:22:08.050 --> 00:22:10.550
Oh yeah. Sonic! Where's Sonic?

00:22:10.760 --> 00:22:12.010
It can't be...

00:22:12.510 --> 00:22:14.770
Did he get caught in the explosion?

00:22:15.730 --> 00:22:19.190
Sonic will be fine. Right?

00:22:32.160 --> 00:22:33.410
Hey!

00:22:33.870 --> 00:22:34.950
Sonic!

00:22:37.410 --> 00:22:38.540
Sonic!

00:22:40.380 --> 00:22:42.290
Here I am!

00:22:45.000 --> 00:22:48.840
<b>Tabidatsu junbi wa dekita kai?</b>

00:22:45.000 --> 00:22:48.840
<i>Are you ready to go on a journey?</i>

00:22:48.840 --> 00:22:52.100
<b>mata hitotsu asa ga kuru</b>

00:22:48.840 --> 00:22:52.100
<i>Another morning has arrived</i>

00:22:52.100 --> 00:22:55.660
<b>Atarashii shatsu ni kigaete</b>

00:22:52.100 --> 00:22:55.660
<i>Change into a new shirt</i>

00:22:55.660 --> 00:22:59.120
<b>Kurayami wo nukedasou</b>

00:22:55.660 --> 00:22:59.120
<i>And escape the darkness</i>

00:22:59.120 --> 00:23:02.540
<b>Nemuranai machi wa kyou mo</b>

00:22:59.120 --> 00:23:06.690
<i>The sleepless city quietly watches over you again today</i>

00:23:02.540 --> 00:23:06.690
<b>Shizuka ni tada mimamotteiru</b>

00:23:09.510 --> 00:23:12.720
<b>Kimi to boku ga hajimatteyuku!</b>

00:23:09.510 --> 00:23:12.720
<i>We begin to go!</i>

00:23:12.720 --> 00:23:16.330
<b>To be shine, To be free</b>

00:23:16.330 --> 00:23:19.100
<b>Tomadowanai de</b>

00:23:16.330 --> 00:23:19.100
<i>Don't be bewildered</i>

00:23:19.770 --> 00:23:25.960
<b>Toki no nami wa tsuyoku yasashii</b>

00:23:19.770 --> 00:23:25.960
<i>The waves of time are strong and kind</i>

00:23:26.900 --> 00:23:31.010
<b>Sugu ni sugu ni kimi wo mukae ni yuku</b>

00:23:26.900 --> 00:23:31.010
<i>I will come quickly to meet you</i>

00:23:33.850 --> 00:23:37.140
<b>Kimi to boku no sekai wo terasou</b>

00:23:33.850 --> 00:23:37.140
<i>Shine a light on our world</i>

00:23:37.140 --> 00:23:40.640
<b>To be shine, To be free</b>

00:23:40.640 --> 00:23:44.150
<b>Kowagaranai de</b>

00:23:40.640 --> 00:23:44.150
<i>Don't be scared</i>

00:23:44.150 --> 00:23:50.320
<b>Toki no nami wa tsuyoku yasashii</b>

00:23:44.150 --> 00:23:50.320
<i>The waves of time are strong and kind</i>

00:23:51.240 --> 00:23:54.740
<b>Haruka tooi michi no mukou gawa e</b>

00:23:51.240 --> 00:23:54.740
<i>At the other end of the very long road</i>

00:23:54.740 --> 00:23:58.200
<b>Sugu ni sugu ni kimi wo mukae ni yuku</b>

00:23:54.740 --> 00:23:58.200
<i>I will come quickly to meet you</i>

00:23:58.200 --> 00:24:02.330
<b>Kimi to boku no mirai mitsukeyou ze</b>

00:23:58.200 --> 00:24:02.330
<i>Let's find our future</i>

00:24:30.260 --> 00:25:35.360
Chase After the Hero Sonic!
